flowchart TD
    A[Open Kalash Gold terminal] --> B[Authenticate approved device]
    B --> C{Active and signature valid?}
    C -- No --> D[Show sign-in error]
    C -- Yes --> E[Show finance screens]
    E --> F{Choose task}
    F --> G[Set today's rates]
    F --> H[Search or register customer]
    F --> I[Create sale invoice]
    F --> J[Buy customer gold]
    F --> K[Settle customer debt]
    F --> L[Record expense]
    F --> M[Review or close logbook]
    F --> N[View date-range profit]
    G --> O[Protected API validates input]
    I --> H
    J --> H
    K --> H
    O --> P{Owner-only action?}
    P -- Yes --> Q[Verify owner PIN and record audit]
    P -- No --> R[Run transaction]
    Q --> R
    R --> S{Inputs and business rules pass?}
    S -- No --> T[Rollback and show actionable error]
    S -- Yes --> U[Write business records and source-linked logbook]
    U --> V[Update customer or inventory balance if needed]
    V --> W[Commit and return result]
    W --> X[Display result or print invoice, voucher, or receipt]
    M --> Y{Close day?}
    Y -- Yes --> P
    Y -- No --> Z[Show cash totals and all logbook detail]
    N --> AA[Show revenue, purchase costs, expenses, and inclusive-day average]
